name: beforecode
description: Plans for this repository live in BeforeCode (`bfc`). Use whenever the user mentions BeforeCode or bfc, or talks about plans, intents or acceptance criteria; grilling an idea; writing or reviewing a plan; what to work on next or which plan is approved; or what waits on them (reviews, questions), even without saying "BeforeCode".
